# The shell scripts below are committed with CRLF, and Docker COPY ships the
# checkout verbatim, so bash inside the image failed on `set -euo pipefail\r`
# ("invalid option name") on every platform. Pin LF for anything executed inside
# a container or by a CI runner.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Dockerfile.* text eol=lf

# Binary media must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
